# PHASE ORDER

### Phase 0 — Safety
1. Rate limiting · 2. Atomicity/idempotency · 3. Adjustments · 4. DB invariants · 5. Backup · 6. Monitoring · 7. Critical tests · 8. CI · 9. Auth/tenant audit

### Phase 1 — Core Product + Pilot minimum
10. Profile editor · 11. Navigation · 12. Customer UX · 13. Support admin · 14. Point expiry · 15. Audit log · 16. Staff permissions · 17. Camera QR · 18. Pilot legal minimum

### Phase 2 — Growth
19. Analytics · 20. Broadcast · 21. Referrals · 22. Loyalty rules · 23. Segmentation · 24. Multi-location

### Phase 3 — Compliance research & review
25. Data residency research · 26. Security review

### Phase 4 — Engineering
27. Expanded tests · 28. Prisma fallback · 29. Developer docs · 30. Migration discipline · 31. Runbook

